#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE2335 expect=violation domain=TS
#note "No TSPARMCD=TRTUNII record anywhere in TS -> the 'Study Agent Unique Ingredient Identifier' parameter is missing, one dataset-level finding. the near-miss parameters TRT (a proper prefix of TRTUNII), TRTDOS and TRTV would wrongly silence the rule under a prefix match."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset TS class="TRIAL DESIGN" label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col TSSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col TSPARMCD type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter Short Name"
col TSPARM   type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter"
col TSVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
S01 | TS | 1 | TRT      | Protocol Agent                             | TEST ARTICLE X
S01 | TS | 2 | TRTDOS   | Dose                                       | 100
S01 | TS | 3 | TRTV     | Drug Vehicle                               | SALINE
